      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَحْومٌ</span></b>  <i>That impels,</i> or <i>propels, much,</i> or <i>vehemently:</i> (K:) applied to a bow; as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَحُورٌ</span>:
